uit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[19,17,76,78,51,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1017","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[19,17,76,78,51,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1017","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[19,17,76,78,51,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1017","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[19,17,76,78,51,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1017","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[19,17,76,78,51,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1024","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[19,17,76,78,51,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10112","city":"CS1017","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[19,17,76,78,51,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"曹魏官臣，文学家，曹植交好之一。曹操因其父丁冲的功绩，曾想将女儿嫁给他，因曹丕劝阻而作罢。丁仪因没能娶到曹操女儿，对曹丕恨得咬牙切齿，所以和曹植更加亲善。建安年间，丁仪历任西曹掾、尚书等职，与弟弟丁廙、杨修等人组成曹植的核心智囊团，试图立曹植为太子。曹操病逝后，曹丕遣使臣于曹植官邸质问为何不参加殡席，丁仪却回答继位者应为曹植。丁仪被革职下狱，夏侯尚求情未果，最终与其弟丁廙及两家男丁全部被诛杀。","tc":"曹魏官臣，文學家，曹植交好之一。曹操因其父丁沖的功績，曾想將女兒嫁給他，因曹丕勸阻而作罷。丁儀因沒能娶到曹操女兒，對曹丕恨得咬牙切齒，所以和曹植更加親善。建安年間，丁儀歷任西曹掾、尚書等職，與弟弟丁廙、楊修等人組成曹植的核心智囊團，試圖立曹植為太子。曹操病逝后，曹丕遣使臣于曹植官邸質問為何不參加殯席，丁儀卻回答繼位者應為曹植。丁儀被革職下獄，夏侯尚求情未果，最終與其弟丁廙及兩家男丁全部被誅殺。","en":"An official and literary figure of Cao Wei, and one of Cao Zhi's close associates. Because of his father Ding Chong's meritorious service, Cao Cao once wished to marry his daughter to Ding Yi, but was dissuaded by Cao Pi. Resentful over failing to marry Cao Cao's daughter, Ding Yi gnashed his teeth in hatred toward Cao Pi and grew even closer to Cao Zhi. During the Jian'an era, Ding Yi served in various posts including Western Bureau Director and Imperial Secretary. Along with his brother Ding Yi, Yang Xiu, and others, he formed Cao Zhi's core brain trust and actively lobbied for Cao Zhi to be named Crown Prince. After Cao Cao's death, Cao Pi sent an envoy to Cao Zhi's quarters demanding to know why he had not attended the funeral. Ding Yi replied that the rightful heir should have been Cao Zhi. He was stripped of office and imprisoned. Despite Xiahou Shang's pleas for clemency, Ding Yi, his brother, and all male members of both families were executed.","jp":"曹魏の臣であり、文学家。曹植と親交を結んだ一人。父・丁冲の功績により、曹操は娘を彼に嫁がせようとしたが、曹丕の諫言によって取りやめとなった。丁儀は曹操の娘を娶れなかったことから曹丕を深く恨み、曹植との親善をさらに深めた。建安年間、丁儀は西曹掾や尚書などを歴任し、弟の丁廙や楊修らとともに曹植の核心的な側近集団を構成して、曹植を太子に擁立しようと画策した。曹操の病没後、曹丕が曹植の官邸に使者を遣わしてなぜ葬儀に参列しないのかを詰問した際、丁儀は後継者となるべきは曹植であると答えた。これにより丁儀は免官されて投獄され、夏侯尚の取りなしも実らず、最期は弟の丁廙および一族の男子とともに処刑された。","kr":"조위의 관리이자 문학가로, 조식과 친교를 맺었던 인물 중 하나입니다. 조조는 그의 부친 정충의 공적을 생각하여 딸을 시집보내려 했으나, 조비의 만류로 무산되었습니다. 정의는 조조의 딸을 아내로 맞이하지 못하자 조비에게 이를 갈며 깊은 원한을 품었고, 조식과 더욱 두터운 친선을 맺었습니다. 건안 연간에 서조연, 상서 등을 역임했으며, 아우 정이, 양수 등과 함께 조식의 핵심 참모진을 이루어 조식을 태자로 옹립하고자 했습니다. 조조가 병사한 뒤 조비가 조식의 관저로 사신을 보내 장례에 참석하지 않은 연유를 추궁하자, 정의는 후계를 이어받아야 할 자는 마땅히 조식이어야 한다고 대답했습니다. 결국 관직을 삭탈당하고 옥에 갇혔으며, 하후상이 구명을 청했으나 뜻을 이루지 못하고 끝내 아우 정이 및 두 집안의 남정들과 함께 모두 주살되었습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10406","remark":"","surname":"丁","surnameTc":"丁","surnameEn":"Ding","surnameJp":"丁","surnameKr":"정","surnameOther":"","name":"仪","nameTc":"儀","nameEn":"Yi","nameJp":"儀","nameKr":"의","nameOther":"","word":"正礼","wordTc":"正禮","wordEn":"Zhengli","wordJp":"正礼","wordKr":"정례","wordOther":"","icon":"丁仪","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"203","city":"CS1024","gender":"0","rule":"19","force":"17","wise":"76","politics":"78","charm":"51","will":"74","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"6/6/6/6/6/69/27/6","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1002605","warSoulPoint":"300","battleSoulPoint":"200","debateSoulPoint":"4300","strategy":"1004308","strategy2":"1001605","professions":"0/0/0/0/1/0/0/1/3/3/0/0/0/0/0/2/1/3/2/3/0/3/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"14","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2650","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"183","show":"197","death":"220","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"